  "source_findings": {
    "P6": [
      "Same original R/D/G and own-root graph/extraction AST remain in both public comparators. Rank is observed fuel, not raw node identity.",
      "answerMap retains raw-list order, duplicates and zero values. OwnProof supplies internal lookupAgreement; generic map transport is instantiated with this enumeration.",
      "Original finalAnswers is instantiated with the same R/D/G. G output is successor-tagged Some(value), and reverse extraction explicitly cancels successors.",
      "Child lookup transport uses aligned actual predecessor cache and independently observed own rank. Zero-rank impossible child membership follows original strict decrease.",
      "No additional public validity, coverage, Some-definedness, recursive value, or lookup-agreement premise was introduced."
    ],
    "P12": [
      "Native pair/tuple/call recipes match EffectiveNumeralEqualityProof and EffectiveNumeralCallProof, preserving duplicated hs, hp/hq order, tail recursion, and tag/arity header reflexivities.",
      "RuntimeProof obtains runtime tag validity from the installed numeral-prefix program and derives zero-arity/tag/arity reflexivity at the same installation and checker index/fuel.",
      "ValueTraceProof binary/pair/tuple/header/call lemmas preserve literal raw syntax and constructor tags. Numeral calculation is at an actual closed numeral; arbitrary runtime validity remains a separate internal theorem.",
      "TraceCoreProof replacement/transitivity/unary retain literal nested-MP order and arbitrary native input certificate numbers; no successful decode or certificate acceptance is assumed.",
      "TraceCoreProof.unary exposes exact prefix equalities as private helper inputs. Final public trace proof must discharge all three template/specialization equalities for the dynamic binary environment.",
      "ScalarTraceProof.left keeps protected var0 in the left position and lifts closed right u under var1. ScalarTraceProof.right keeps protected var0 in the right position and lifts fixed u on the left. Binary assembly instantiates right with (b,c,d)/(u,v,w), producing c+b to c+d.",
      "All private hF/hft/hfu obligations are discharged by explicit constructor prefix equations, liftEncode, and closedTransport. No new hypothesis appears in the final exact trace contract.",
      "Pair numeric trace retains duplicated sum certificate for multiplication and original left-coordinate certificate in the final addition; no tuple or header reordering.",
      "CertificateTraceProof.tuple follows original tail recursion, arithmetic pair, and successor congruence, with zero-arity reflexivity. Call follows tuple, tag-reflexive pair, arity-reflexive pair, universalFunction congruence.",
      "TraceProof.exactTraces combines all four clauses of the frozen conjunction with the same installation; Proof and StatementChecks bind exactly the original frozen comparator types."
    ]
  },
